# Mobile agent skills

Before writing or editing files under `apps/mobile`, read
`.cursor/skills/showzy-mobile/SKILL.md` and the matching leaf skill
(router, native-ui, design-system, animation, dev-client, or Vercel RN
rules). Skills are advisory: this rule, ADRs, and `apps/mobile/AGENTS.md`
win. Do not follow vendored advice to use NativeWind, `@expo/ui`, Bearer
tokens, raw `fetch`, or to restructure the app.
